# 4️⃣ Minimal integration (VERY IMPORTANT)

### In **CombatDummy.cs**
Add this at the top:
```csharp
StatusOverlayController overlay;
```

In `Awake()`:
```csharp
overlay = GetComponent<StatusOverlayController>();
if (!overlay) overlay = gameObject.AddComponent<StatusOverlayController>();
```

When damage is applied:
```csharp
overlay.SpawnDamage(amount, elementType, isCrit, isDot);
```

When debuffs change (from `StackableDebuffHandler`):
```csharp
overlay.SetStatus("burning", stacks);
overlay.RemoveStatus("burning");
```

